# Compass — shared project orientation

Read `docs/compass/README.md` and `docs/compass/MAP.md` before touching an unfamiliar area. The map routes a task to one capsule and the source files that matter; do not read the whole folder. `docs/compass/STATE.md` says what is actually built.

The steps are in `docs/compass/protocol/start.md` (orient) and `docs/compass/protocol/close.md` (write back). Most sessions write nothing back.

Run `npm run compass` before any commit. Never edit a generated Compass file; change `compass.config.json` and run `compass sync`.
